export anchor ObsidianStyle:
    number: 271
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Obsidian
    idea: Volcanic black glass cut into chamfered slabs, with glowing lava orange cracks marking the selected file, live meters and the paths through the screen.
    base: dark
    palette:
        void: #09080a, page, fact tiles and style sheet
        glass: #141216, slab body, search and view switch
        glassSheen: #1c191f, top left of the slab gradient and secondary buttons
        edge: #2e2930, empty storage shards and tracks
        ink: #f1ebe6, text
        muted: #b3a8a3, meta, caps labels and inactive nav
        lava: #ff7a2f, primary button, cracks, current marker, storage shards and focus
        magma: #ffb07a, badge words and the hot end of the upload flow
        selected: #221510, selected slab and current nav fill
        lavaInk: #1d0900, text on lava
    type:
        One condensed stack, Bahnschrift, DIN Alternate, Roboto Condensed,
        Arial Narrow, Segoe UI. Base 15px. The title is 40px at 700 in caps
        tracked 0.04em, the details title 22px at 700, file names 15px at
        600, meta 14px muted, buttons 13px caps at 700 and labels 12px caps
        tracked 0.12em.
    layout:
        A header with a pentagon mark holding a lava zigzag, BRIGHTWORK
        DRIVE in tracked caps and a chamfered search, underlined edge to
        edge by a glowing jagged lava crack line. Below, three columns. A
        220px slab nav lists the five places, My files with a lava left
        edge, and ends with Storage shown as ten slanted shards, six lit,
        one part lit, three dark, then 64.2 GB of 100 GB. The middle has a
        caps breadcrumb, the caps title, chamfered Upload and New folder
        buttons and a List or Grid chamfered switch, then caps column heads
        and eight chamfered file slabs with name, badges, date, person and
        size. The selected slab glows warm from the left with a lava vein
        drawn down its edge. A 330px details slab shows a chamfered preview
        with a crack line, the name, a Starred badge, four chamfered fact
        tiles and the three buttons. Below 1180px details stack. Below
        760px the nav scrolls sideways and slabs put meta under names.
    spacing: A 4px base. 20px between slabs and columns, 6px between file slabs, 18px slab padding.
    density: Medium dense. Each file is a 52px slab with its meta in columns.
    corners: Chamfered. 12px cuts on the top left and bottom right of slabs, 7px on buttons, fields, badges and tiles.
    borders: No ordinary borders. Inner 1px lines on secondary controls and badges, a 3px lava edge on the current nav item.
    shadows: No drop shadows. Slabs carry a 135 degree glass gradient and a faint white sheen, and lava lines glow with a 2px blur.
    icons:
        18px line icons in muted grey, lava when current or selected.
        Chamfered caps badges in magma pair a filled star with Starred,
        two heads with Shared ×4 and an up arrow ring with Uploading 62%
        over a lava gradient flow bar.
    focus: A 2px lava outline with a 3px offset, and the chamfer drops away so the outline is whole.
    tone: Short caps labels such as Drive, Storage and Shared ×4 over plain values.
